      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7df9a2402955c162ed7b810b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "海塞克",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5fabe59dbfc69b351e5555a867f493fcf8f1a3ed77a8e6c5a84b2b3f28f1026",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6",
        "9048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea1178887ff42863f84c86a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "塔可布莱恩",
      "source_fingerprint": "71539c29764081b35703fe8aa8d1a8790f264614e5d9d3fc1495435e3138d2b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6",
        "9049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:823c498deac47c3d1d135baf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "保科健子",
      "source_fingerprint": "645d491ebae1a7b6a1f99e2d8c9847055d2ae073a45a7e560275e4958b367263",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6",
        "9050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b5b862476e5b0a5a19d6557",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "汤华盛放",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b2e5f32de1d67199658df06ca0466b0cb68a3f9e36a772aa09d436a856516ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6",
        "9051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53e5f12e9f847558862f82ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园中每天都有很多事发生。\\n选择<color=#ff9900>育成剧本</color>，解决学园的问题吧。\\n攻略剧本也关系到赛马娘的成长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "560c8788babc0498985033dbb7b3279f87ac3dd2de2cb6ce0a92515f1a72d35c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52fd800d18aeeb8c3edfc143",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用<color=#ff9900>支援点数</color>和<color=#ff9900>金币</color>来进行<color=#ff9900>Lv强化</color>吧。\\nLv提升后会增加支援效果，\\n因此可以在育成中取得优势。\\n强化素材可从育成或每日比赛中获得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd2567586af7aab22f115e62cc65d40ba2b4ec703ab6dff7c3580f3e3ebabebd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daf94a7394e191da3fc172e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成时，比赛中有时也存在「劲敌」。\\n在有劲敌的<color=#ff9900>比赛中取得胜利</color>的话\\n<color=#ff9900>基础能力将上升</color>，<color=#ff9900>也可获得技能的折扣</color>。\\n战胜强敌，帮助赛马娘成长吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22a2d13cdeb71abfa024e0227c845a4c77d893744ad058f94886ca6aa4efd397",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b58f48daabffdfa934702df5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在闪耀明星巅峰赛中，\\n<color=#ff9900>可根据各比赛的名次获得「胜利Pt」</color>，\\n<color=#ff9900>3场比赛合计Pt最高的赛马娘将获胜</color>。\\n和育成的赛马娘一起，以顶点为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88522577d647a3028ed3110563ab4d43150648c55eab3f378b660d122997de02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa951d7dbd7393d0e57f4a62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在练习中，可设定<color=#ff9900>喜欢的条件</color>来自由地举办比赛。\\n除了自己育成的殿堂赛马娘，\\n还可以和<color=#ff9900>其他训练员的赛马娘一起</color>参加比赛。\\n最大可让18名赛马娘一起练习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "430b81f44a136a8d558afc56187aa060516123024e74300efa1f112b8d685e48",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7d1c6763893bdf3854ab439",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将在团队竞技场或房间竞赛等注意到的赛马娘\\n登记为<color=#ff9900>练习伙伴</color>，\\n可以与其一起参赛。\\n另外，所关注好友的代表赛马娘也可参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "722390448129198d32ee6a3d6a34b33dd5c233111d726ac78badcbb2b87ea622",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:490db9666b75b9e6ed0f09bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以将自己自豪的<color=#ff9900>殿堂赛马娘</color>在社团或SNS<color=#ff9900>分享</color>。\\n积极与社团成员或朋友登录为练习伙伴，\\n丰富自己的练习吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "372e99fe12d6bc009570e7b08863cf2ab99ac0e8c0a7a1abd1b12ea2953dccea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e289c38bcd501baeb5aff859",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将想要反复练习的赛马娘们保存到<color=#ff9900>我的参赛名单</color>中、\\n参赛登记时就可以<color=#ff9900>立刻调出</color>！\\n也可以从练习后的结算画面保存，好好活用吧。\\n另外，请注意在解除练习伙伴后，\\n也会将其从我的参赛名单中解除。",
      "source_fingerprint": "662a05795c489af378b7c62fcdda11c478e1c2d5324bb134842e653a7368daaa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2de47cba08bbcbc8bb54712",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将想要反复练习的赛马娘们保存到<color=#ff9900>我的参赛名单</color>中、\\n参赛登记时就可以<color=#ff9900>立刻调出</color>！\\n也可以从练习后的结算画面保存，好好活用吧。\\n另外，请注意在解除练习伙伴后，\\n也会将其从我的参赛名单中解除。",
      "source_fingerprint": "662a05795c489af378b7c62fcdda11c478e1c2d5324bb134842e653a7368daaa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:103897f33b8d4d3fb1e2cd66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可在此查看所有考试项目的<color=#ff9900>得分排名TOP100位</color>！\\n<color=#ff9900>TOP30的殿堂赛马娘</color>将作为活动租借对象，\\n且<color=#ff9900>没有</color><color=#ff9900>租借次数上限</color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23117225391dff2209725956510001bb55a473a3501dd12cdf432b6bd459b16a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5d32ee0b022ee35d3713447",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可通过参与考试来获得<color=#ff9900>考试币</color>，\\n且在<color=#ff9900>分数奖励</color>或<color=#ff9900>考试评价</color>、<color=#ff9900>任务</color>中\\n能获得更多考试币！",
      "source_fingerprint": "104dbcf7d96e81e353817e6a227693f1a68b5bb39866e6d55a42322cd8ec42ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4d025dd090b78789ca56a3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用<color=#ff9900>强化素材</color>，\\n提升育成赛马娘技能的<color=#ff9900>折扣Lv</color>吧。\\n通过提升折扣Lv，\\n育成时的初始<color=#ff9900>折扣Lv</color>将会提高。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ccf1dd3d3e809f781200c8c18cc197702e644b3b7c2846d444381ad90e7f8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6748024f4d011620c807bc3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用<color=#ff9900>相同支援卡</color>来进行<color=#ff9900>上限解锁</color>吧。\\n解锁上限后，支援卡等级上限将会提升，\\n可以将支援卡强化至更高的等级。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a16ccb8857b5325e8d833d069fb6cb0fb92ee5427257871181188956069c4f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27ee4262da66eea5182084df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加竞速嘉年华的比赛可获得<color=#ff9900>嘉年华点数</color>\\n根据比赛中发动的技能数、名次等，\\n可获得的嘉年华点数会增加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2823bcfc10d2f77084f78bef761647ad60c88f4c21b2bd9078cb306dcae36567",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d437c178d87c88dc9b0b3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "挑战<color=#ff9900>嘉年华比赛</color>可以积累<color=#ff9900>挑战槽</color>。\\n挑战槽积累到最大值时会出现<color=#ff9900>挑战比赛</color>\\n挑战比赛将从<color=#ff9900>VERY HARD、EXTREME</color>中\\n随机出现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b44ce75229e99d291ce87f993c24ed61a7293854b34e3614f598dccf9c0b8d6a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:774e8a21112f948180f45dcf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "活动比赛中进入前5名可获得<color=#ff9900>嘉年华BONUS因子</color>。\\n在育成中继承因子的话，育成赛马娘可获得\\n<color=#ff9900>嘉年华BONUS技能</color>。\\n拥有嘉年华BONUS技能的赛马娘参加活动比赛时\\n<color=#ff9900>基础能力值上升，干劲为绝好调的概率上升。</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68a0470d78c0984bc648015e4d267330966f59585d53ee394cf5e80dce2ed7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26930463ecc950a4efa177d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拥有<color=#ff9900>嘉年华BONUS技能</color>的赛马娘在活动比赛中进入\\n前5名的话，获得的嘉年华BONUS因子将\\n<color=#ff9900>升级</color>。\\n继承的技能Lv越高，基础能力的上升值\\n越高，干劲为绝好调的概率也越高。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f2172a00bec60ac3131c8956e1602d17f354acd40aac51dc6642d7f0e7c10db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce6e656f8c5e29ad99ac6d41",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在竞速嘉年华比赛中获得的<color=#ff9900>嘉年华点数</color>可在\\n商店中<color=#ff9900>兑换物品</color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b7ec4a8287b86d18a721377c915ff98f961c6d0a6cc42d5394ecb1729841536",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17a95234d4c96877b57bb62d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "挑战每日传奇比赛吧。\\n可以获得相应的对战LEGEND赛马娘碎片。\\n每天入场券都会补充至<color=#ff9900>最大张数</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef7750d50dc203ca7c62bc43fdeeec6201e803b0a599a25929fefcb1ea6636bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4325cf8552029f9efc9aee5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你可以制作自己的<color=#ff9900>原创名片</color>，并将名片（图片）\\n<color=#ff9900>分享到SNS上</color>。\\n除训练员信息外，你还可以<color=#ff9900>自定义展示</color>自己喜欢的\\n赛马娘、支援卡以及照片等图像。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb3d37984e1f0e7dd9e3b6fb4a8b6a18a0af740791c872c4d2990f019a8ec994",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4023a1d2df51c088a423e7df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "代表赛马娘所持有的<color=#ff9900>因子信息</color>也可以在<color=#ff9900>SNS上共享</color>。\\n使用名片功能来展示让自己引以为豪的赛马娘吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27b42267faf9ff5aeb56fec4f92bea53c020427788889ee89e93ed7cbd266008",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "117"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
